WEBVTT

00:10:01.013 --> 00:10:02.348
That's not all.

00:10:02.848 --> 00:10:05.851
The Notre Dame Institute
tells us, with this map,

00:10:05.851 --> 00:10:09.396
in which you see, again,
some red and orange,

00:10:09.396 --> 00:10:11.857
that countries that are climate vulnerable

00:10:11.899 --> 00:10:14.735
are also the ones
that are resource endowed.

00:10:15.736 --> 00:10:17.404
And one final thing.

00:10:18.530 --> 00:10:21.742
You know those big ecosystems
that we need to protect and regenerate

00:10:21.784 --> 00:10:24.036
in order to stabilize
the global climate regime?

00:10:24.078 --> 00:10:25.954
To reboot the hydrological cycle

00:10:25.996 --> 00:10:27.831
and to protect biodiversity?

00:10:28.415 --> 00:10:32.211
They're also represented
in orange and red on this map.